2. **Range-weighted intraday reversal**
   - Signal:
     \[
     -\left(\frac{\text{close}_t}{\text{open}_t}-1\right)
     \times
     \operatorname{clip}\left(
     \frac{(\text{high}_t-\text{low}_t)/\text{open}_t}
     {\operatorname{rollingMedian}_{20}((\text{high}-\text{low})/\text{open})},
     0,4\right)
     \]
   - Extends intraday reversal by assigning greater weight to unusually wide-range sessions.
   - Uses only completed OHLC observations and predicts the next valid close-to-close return.

