### Explored Factors

#### Smoothed Range-Weighted Intraday Reversal

Construction:

\[
\text{raw}_t =
-\left(\frac{close_t}{open_t}-1\right)
\times
\operatorname{clip}\left(
\frac{(high_t-low_t)/open_t}
{\operatorname{rollingMedian}_{20}((high-low)/open)},
0,4
\right)
\]

The final signal applies a three-observation exponentially weighted mean and a one-period lag:

\[
\text{signal}_t=\operatorname{EWM}_{3}(\text{raw}_{t-1})
\]

