### Explored Factors

#### Asymmetric Volatility-Scaled Two-Day Reversal — Revalidation

The factor ranks recent two-day losers positively for reversal, scales the signal by 20-day volatility, and amplifies it when downside semivolatility is elevated:

\[
F_t =
-\frac{C_t/C_{t-2}-1}{\sigma_{20,t}}
\left[
1+0.5\cdot
\operatorname{clip}
\left(
\frac{D_{20,t}-\operatorname{median}_{60}(D_{20})}
{\operatorname{std}_{60}(D_{20})},
0,2
\right)
\right]
\]

The signal is lagged and evaluated only with completed data.

