The benchmark admission gates are absolute daily IC ≥ 0.0070 and absolute daily ICIR ≥ 0.0840. None of the candidates passed both daily gates. The downside-risk-adjusted trend showed positive daily IC but insufficient daily ICIR. Its positive longer-horizon behavior is potentially useful for future 10-day portfolio research, but does not qualify for factor-library admission under the current daily gate.

