- Expand regime analysis for the volatility-compression trend before considering admission; its apparent strength is concentrated in a short recent sample.
- Explore robust combinations of medium-term momentum and downside-risk control with lower turnover.
- Continue avoiding admission of factors whose daily ICIR fails the benchmark-wide threshold, even when longer-horizon IC appears attractive.

