### Explored Factors

#### Signed Cross-Asset Breadth-Confirmed Momentum

Tested a volatility-scaled 15-day momentum factor conditioned on cross-asset breadth:

\[
F_t =
\operatorname{shift}_1\left[
\frac{R_{15d,t}}{\sigma_{20d,t}}
\left(0.5 + B_{20d,t}\right)
\right]
\]

where \(B_{20d}\) is the average fraction of assets recording positive daily returns over the trailing 20 sessions.

The signed breadth multiplier strengthens momentum exposure in broadly positive tapes and attenuates, without reversing, momentum exposure during broadly weak tapes. The one-day lag prevents look-ahead.

