### Explored Factors

#### Range-Efficiency Momentum

Tested a signed 20-session momentum signal weighted by directional path efficiency:

\[
F_t =
\operatorname{shift}_1\left[
R_{20,t}
\cdot
\frac{|R_{20,t}|}
{\sum_{i=1}^{20}|r_{i,t}|+\epsilon}
\right]
\]

The factor favors assets whose net movement is large relative to the total path traveled, thereby discounting noisy or mean-reverting price paths. The one-session lag avoids look-ahead.

