### Explored Factors

#### Efficiency-Weighted Volatility-Adjusted 15-Day Trend

Construction:

\[
F_t =
\operatorname{shift}\left[
\frac{R_{15,t}}
{\sigma_{20,t}\sqrt{20}}
\left(
0.5+
\frac{|R_{20,t}|}{\sum_{i=0}^{19}|r_{t-i}|+\epsilon}
\right),1
\right]
\]

The factor combines signed 15-session momentum, volatility scaling, and a trend-efficiency weight. Persistent directional moves receive larger scores, while noisy price paths are downweighted. The one-session lag prevents look-ahead bias.

