- Other factors selected by the existing ensemble

remain subject to their latest stored validation and downstream correlation checks.

### Plans

- Investigate conditional versions of trend and reversal signals using VIX, cross-asset dispersion, and volatility-shock regimes.
- Test residualized signals to reduce overlap with the existing persistent-trend and reversal factors.
- Prefer candidates with positive same-horizon IC across multiple regimes and stronger date-level IC stability.
- Revalidate older effective factors as their stored validation dates age.

