### Explored Factors

#### Cross-Asset Relative Momentum with Short-Term Acceleration

Construction:

\[
F_t=\operatorname{shift}_1\left[
(R_{20,t}-\operatorname{median}_{CS}(R_{20,t}))
+0.35(R_{5,t}-\operatorname{median}_{CS}(R_{5,t}))
\right]
\]

The factor measures each asset’s relative 20-day momentum versus the available cross-section and adds a smaller short-term acceleration component. All inputs are lagged by one session to prevent look-ahead bias.

### Validation Results

| Horizon | Mean IC | ICIR | Valid dates |
