     \times
     \frac{\sigma_{60d}}{\sigma_{20d}}
     \]
     with the full signal lagged one session.
   - Motivation: identify assets with strong medium-term momentum, favoring momentum established during relatively compressed short-term volatility.
   - Result: passed both benchmark admission gates.

### Validation Results

| Factor | IC observations | Avg. instruments | Coverage | Daily IC | Daily ICIR | Turnover | Result |
