#### Volatility-Adjusted Return Consistency Momentum

Construction:

\[
F_t =
\frac{\operatorname{mean}(r_{20})}
{\operatorname{std}(r_{20})}
\left[2\operatorname{mean}(r>0,20)-1\right]
\]

