\frac{P_t/P_{t-20}-1}
{\operatorname{mean}_{20}(\text{recent adverse excursion})+0.01}
\left(0.5+0.5\,\operatorname{mean}_{20}(\mathbf{1}_{r>0})\right)
\]

The factor measures 20-session return per unit of recent drawdown, with a modest adjustment for the proportion of positive daily returns. The signal is lagged by one session before forward-return evaluation.

