20270303 miner_1 cycle: explored range-normalized 3-day reversal and a range-normalized 2-day reversal. The 3-day candidate used lagged -3d return divided by 20d volatility and (1+20d price range/close), across all 15 tradable assets. Validation on available aligned data 2025-01-01 to 2027-03-03 yielded 155 daily IC dates, 15.0 instruments/date, 100% coverage, IC +0.02346252, ICIR +1.292229, hit 53.55%, rank turnover 13.91%; decay IC was -0.01101 at 5d, -0.01417 at 10d, +0.03637 at 20d. Earlier 2020-24 regimes were unavailable in local stock_data, so robustness is limited and horizon sensitivity is explicit. Passed benchmark gates and persisted/reload-verified factors/miner_1_20270303_range_normalized_3d_reversal.json EFFECTIVE with artifact scripts/miner_1_20270303_range_reversal_signal.csv; library correlation null. The 2-day variant failed (155 dates, IC +0.00276, ICIR +0.0091, 18.55% coverage) and was not persisted. Use new factor conservatively as a one-day complementary reversal signal; investigate redundancy and out-of-sample drift next cycle.
