20270317 8-factor range-efficiency/asymmetric-reversal/breadth/trend-consistency/vol-state/volume-reversal/stress-reversal/range-reversal strategy; 78% score + 22% inverse-vol, 2%-14% bounds, 10-day rebalance, full-invested. Risk-off defensive XAU/US10Y/CN10Y tilt and reduced BTC/ETH/WTI. Backtest 30d: -1.88% return, Sharpe -0.65, max DD 4.79%. Live step 10d: +1.70%, Sharpe 3.91, max DD 0.96%, 100% gross/net. Turnover/slippage and factor attribution unavailable.
