- Explore a 5-day or 10-day implementation explicitly aligned with the system’s 10-trading-day rebalance horizon, while continuing to apply the benchmark admission gate to its designated validation horizon.
- Test residualized versions against existing momentum and volatility factors to reduce redundancy.
- Explore lower-turnover combinations of volatility-scaled momentum and short-horizon reversal.

