20270303 miner_1 cycle: explored range-normalized 3-day reversal and a range-normalized 2-day reversal. The 3-day candidate used lagged -3d return divided by 20d volatility and (1+20d price range/close), across all 15 tradable assets. Validation on available aligned data 2025-01-01 to 2027-03-03 yielded 155 daily IC dates, 15.0 instruments/date, 100% coverage, IC +0.02346252, ICIR +1.292229, hit 53.55%, rank turnover 13.91%; decay IC was -0.01101 at 5d, -0.01417 at 10d, +0.03637 at 20d. Earlier 2020-24 regimes were unavailable in local stock_data, so robustness is limited and horizon sensitivity is explicit. Passed benchmark gates and persisted/reload-verified factors/miner_1_20270303_range_normalized_3d_reversal.json EFFECTIVE with artifact scripts/miner_1_20270303_range_reversal_signal.csv; library correlation null. The 2-day variant failed (155 dates, IC +0.00276, ICIR +0.0091, 18.55% coverage) and was not persisted. Use new factor conservatively as a one-day complementary reversal signal; investigate redundancy and out-of-sample drift next cycle.
20270317 8-factor range-efficiency/asymmetric-reversal/breadth/trend-consistency/vol-state/volume-reversal/stress-reversal/range-reversal strategy; 78% score + 22% inverse-vol, 2%-14% bounds, 10-day rebalance, full-invested. Risk-off defensive XAU/US10Y/CN10Y tilt and reduced BTC/ETH/WTI. Backtest 30d: -1.88% return, Sharpe -0.65, max DD 4.79%. Live step 10d: +1.70%, Sharpe 3.91, max DD 0.96%, 100% gross/net. Turnover/slippage and factor attribution unavailable.
20270317 trader cycle: Exact 7-factor ensemble; lagged cross-asset ranks with 78/22 score-vol weighting, 2%-14% bounds, 10-day rebalance, full-investment. Added explicit downside, range-efficiency, consistency, vol-state, stress/VIX reversal, and recovery mappings; defensive XAU/US10Y/CN10Y tilt under risk-off. Backtest 30d: +0.59%, Sharpe 0.33, max DD 5.36%; live step 10d: +1.78%, Sharpe 2.66, max DD 1.75%, 100% gross/net. No factor attribution or turnover/slippage detail exposed; monitor reversal overlap and momentum crowding.
20270226 cycle: replaced strategy with exact 7-factor ensemble (asymmetric reversal 0.23, signed breadth 0.18, trend consistency 0.17, vol-state 0.14, range efficiency 0.13, continuous stress 0.08, VIX stress 0.07); full-invested 15-asset long-only, 2%-14% bounds, inverse-vol overlay, 10-day cadence, lagged features and deterministic 10-day forecasts. 30-day backtest returned +0.71%, Sharpe 0.47, max drawdown 5.65%. Live block 20270226-20270312 returned -1.80%, Sharpe -6.19, max drawdown 2.00%; gross/net 100%, no execution failures reported. High-risk recovery tilt and defensive XAU/US10Y/CN10Y overlays were insufficient; monitor reversal overlap and regime mismatch.

