- The continuous VIX-stress reversal was not increased because miners reported materially negative performance in the 2025–2027 regime.
- Elevated volatility creates execution and migration-cost risk; downstream implementation should smooth ranks and avoid unnecessary turnover.
- Defensive tradable assets such as XAU, US10Y, and CN10Y remain important under risk-off conditions. No cash sleeve is introduced.

