- **Momentum/Trend:** risk-adjusted momentum, persistence momentum, compression breakout, trend consistency, volatility-state momentum, breadth-confirmed momentum, downside-scaled trend.
- **Reversal/Stress:** asymmetric-volatility reversal, volume-confirmed reversal, VIX-stress reversal, continuous-stress reversal, dispersion reversal, range-weighted reversal.
